# Production browser smoke diagnostics
production-smoke-artifacts/

# Claude desktop nests session worktrees here; committed so tools that read only
# .gitignore (Biome, markdownlint globs) skip them. Fleet canon: new-solly-repo row 13.
.claude/worktrees/
# Claude harness state, at any depth (a session started in a subdirectory writes there).
# deploy:infra's gate_require_landed disregards .git/info/exclude and the global excludes
# file, and refuses any untracked path no committed .gitignore ignores, so a checkout where
# Claude ran stays deployable only with these listed. Fleet canon: new-solly-repo row 13.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
**/.claude/routines/.state/
**/.claude/checkpoints/
**/.claude/mailbox/
**/.claude/agent-registry.json
**/.claude/agent-memory-local
**/.claude/first-run
**/.claude/assistant-daemon-state.json

